    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really trying to avoid the clinic if i can, it's super expensive and i'm busy all week. honestly it doesn't even hurt that much now, just a little throbbing. if i just scrub it really well with some antiseptic and maybe put some antibiotic ointment on it, is there really a huge difference between that and going in? i feel like i can handle it myself if i'm careful.",
